ital status</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Married</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.15 (0.87-1.51)</td><td align="right" rowspan="6" colspan="1">.66</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Divorced</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.10 (0.79-1.54)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Widowed</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.88 (0.58-1.33)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Separated</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.08 (0.70-1.67)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Never married</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1.13 (0.81-1.56)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Unmarried couple</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1 [Reference]</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="col" colspan="3" rowspan="1"><bold>Education<xref rid="T2FN1" ref-type="table-fn">a</xref></bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Less than high school graduate</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.64 (0.50-0.82)</td><td align="right" rowspan="4" colspan="1">.002</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">High school graduate</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.81 (0.65-1.03)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Some college</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.89 (0.71-1.13)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Graduated from college</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">1 [Reference]</td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="col" colspan="3" rowspan="1"><bold>Smoking status</bold></td></tr><tr><td align="left" scope="row" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Current smoker (every day)</td><td align="right" rowspan="1" colspan="1">0.84 (0.65-1.07)</td><td align="right" rowspan="4" colspan="1">.29</td></t